    "language": "si-ta-en",
    "md5": "05ad312aa0ecb9a02c8ec529dfdba9cb",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1907,
    "chunk_text": "District were brought in. One of our Members of Parliament was assaulted by those very same goons. There are cases against those people. They were the ones who were brought in to create mayhem. The ordinary, Sinhala general public did not oppose it because they voted for you. They voted for the Hon. Tamil Member from Trincomalee who represents your party. So, it is your duty not to reverse and capitulate. On the contrary, what you must do is, you must go to the people and tell them the truth; you must explain to them what is right; you must explain to them the injustice that has been done. Instead of that, you have completely betrayed those Tamils and non-Sinhala voters who trusted you and voted for you. That is what you have done. So, Sir, this must change.\n\nIt is for that reason, Sir, that, when the ITAK calls for a Division today on the Votes of the Ministry of Justice and National Integration, we will be supporting their call to vote against it; it is because, on the question of the heinous crimes that were committed during the war, this Ministry and the Ministry of Foreign Affairs, Foreign Employment and Tourism have, in the same way that all previous governments behaved, systematically tried to ensure that the victims would not get justice. So, if you all are not going to follow in their footsteps, then, surely, you cannot be standing for the same principles and for the same actions they had been pursuing. So, for that simple reason, we will be voting against this Ministry, Sir.\n\nThank you. \u0d9c\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dcf\u0dc3\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dd6\u0daa \u0dd9\u0db1\u0dca\u0dd3\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dd9\u0dcf (\u0bc8\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0ba4\u0bae\u0bb2\u0bae\u0bc8\u0ba4\u0bc6\u0bbe\u0b99\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bcd \u0b89\u0bb1\u0bc1\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bbf\u0ba9\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Presiding Member) \u0dc3\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4\u0dad\u0dd2\u0db1\u0dca, \u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0dca \u0dc0\u0dd3\u0dad\u0dd4\u0dca\u0db1\u0dd2. \u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0dbd\u0db0\u0dd2\u0dd2\u0dbb\u0dab \u0d87\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0dad\u0dd4\u0dca\u0d9a.\n\n353 354\n\n\u0dca\u0d9a\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dd2\u0daf\u0dda \u0dc0\u0dad\u0dd4\u0dc0"
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_hansard_2020s",
