    "chunk_text": "5. Has the Government formulated a national strategy or action plan to maximize Sri Lanka\u2019s contributions to and benefits from the Conclave\u2019s five pillars, particularly in collaboration with India and other member States, relating to counter-terrorism, cyber security and humanitarian assistance?\n\nSir, I am made to understand that Sri Lanka is a beneficiary of the Deputy Secretary-General post. That is one of the reasons why I am pushing for this so that Sri Lanka gets included in its map.\n\n7. Will the Government commit to deepening Sri Lanka\u2019s engagement in the Colombo Security Conclave to fully utilize this platform - especially the operational, technological and intelligence cooperation extended by India - to protect our territorial integrity, secure our maritime routes and to curb the inflow of narcotics and transnational criminal activity?\n\n8. Has the Government considered enabling visa-\n\nfree, visa-on-arrival or fast-track travel facilitation for authorized officials, delegates and technical personnel from Colombo Security Conclave member States attending meetings, training programmes, or joint operations in Sri Lanka and likewise, pursuing reciprocal arrangements for Sri Lankan defence and security officials travelling to Colombo Security Conclave member countries?\n\nThank you, Sir.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0db1\u0db8\u0dca\u0db1\u0dbb\u0dca \u0db1\u0db1\u0db1\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0dda (\u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0db8\u0dd2\u0dad\u0d9a) \u0d85\u0dbb\u0dd4\u0dab \u0db1\u0dba\u0db1\u0dc3\u0dcf\u0db1\u0d9a\u0dbb \u0dd9\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0dab\u0dbb\u0d9a\u0dca\u0dc0 \u0d9a \u0db1\u0dd2\u0db1\u0dba \u0db1\u0dba \u0d85\u0dd9\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dba\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dd9\u0dcf) (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0bae\u0bae\u0b9c\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0ba4\u0b9c\u0ba9\u0bb0\u0bb2\u0bcd (\u0b93\u0baf\u0bcd\u0bb5\u0bc1\u0ba4\u0baa\u0bb1\u0bcd\u0bb1) \u0b85\u0bb0\u0bc1\u0bc8 \u0b9c\u0baf\u0bae\u0b9a\u0b95\u0bb0 - \u0baa\u0bbe\u0ba4\u0bc1\u0b95\u0bbe\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0baa\u0bcd \u0baa\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0ba4\u0bbf \u0b85\u0b95\u0bae\u0b9a\u0bcd\u0b9a\u0bb0\u0bcd) (The Hon. Major General (Rtd.) Aruna Jayasekera - Deputy Minister of Defence) Hon. Speaker, the Question raised by the Hon. Ravi Karunanayake under Standing Order No. 27(2) is about the Colombo Security Conclave. The Government is very well aware of its benefits. The Question contains eight parts. So, I kindly request for a two weeks\u2019 time duration to answer the Question.\n\nThank you, Sir.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0d9a\u0dbb\u0dd4\u0dab\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a \u0dd9\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0bb0\u0bb5\u0bbf \u0b95\u0bb0\u0bc1\u0bc8\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95) (The Hon. Ravi Karunanayake) Hon. Speaker, -"
