    "chunk_size_bytes": 1361,
    "chunk_text": "\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0dd3\u0dc0.\u0dd3\u0dc0. \u0db1\u0db4\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0db1\u0db8\u0dca\u0db6\u0dbd\u0db8\u0dca \u0dd9\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b9c\u0bc0.\u0b9c\u0bc0. \u0ba4\u0baa\u0bbe\u0ba9\u0bcd\u0ba9\u0bae\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bb2\u0bae\u0bcd) (The Hon. G.G. Ponnambalam) Hon. Presiding Member, you can take the comments I make on these two Ministries - the Ministry of Defence and the Ministry of Public Security and Parliamentary Affairs - in two possible ways. You can take it in a constructive way, where we list out certain issues that are real. Those are issues that are faced by a certain section of this country; those are issues that, if you do not address, are going to create another issue with regard to\n\n531 532\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014 * \u0dd4\u0dc3\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dad\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0db1 \u0dad\u0db6\u0dcf \u0d87\u0dad. * \u0ba8\u0bc2\u0ba9\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bb2\u0baf\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0bb2\u0bcd \u0b95\u0bb5\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0bc1\u0bb3\u0bcd\u0bb3\u0ba4\u0bc1. * Placed in the Library.\n\n\u0db4\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dbd\u0dd2\u0dc0\u0dda\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4\u0dc0\n\nIf I take the Ministry of Defence and if I am to be honest, as far as the Tamil people are concerned, it is the most hated Ministry, not only under this Government, but under previous governments as well; it is the single most hated Ministry under the State structure. Why is it?\n\nIt is because that single Ministry has been the cause for all the suffering that the Tamil people face, not only during the war, but even 16 years after the war. So, what are you going to do about it?"
  },
  {
