    "chunk_text": "The other issue is this. For accountability to seriously happen in this country, if you want the Tamil people to accept that Sri Lanka does not mean only Sinhala Buddhists, that it does not mean that it is only for the Sinhalese and what their intentions for Sri Lanka are, then you must accept that there were very serious crimes that took place during the war. As far as I am concerned, it was genocide. It was genocide, I am making that allegation. Now, what you are going to do about it? The fact of the matter is, you have such a massive presence and these crimes had taken place. I am not the only one who is talking about those crimes, but the whole world is talking about those. Do you want every member of the military, all the three forces, to be suspect of those crimes? Do you all not want to clear your names, if you were not actually involved in it? Is it not in your own interest and in the interest of this country that you clear your names? And, how are you going to clear your names? I know that all of them are not like that because all the evidence of genocide, the crimes against humanity\n\n533 534\n\n[\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0da2\u0dd3.\u0da2\u0dd3. \u0dc0\u0db4\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0db1\u0dda\u0db6\u0dbd\u0dda \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf]\n\n2025 \u0dc0\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dd0\u0dda\u0db6\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dbd 18\n\nNow, the issue is this. Why is there a conflict of interest? Why the JVP would worry about dealing with this in the way we say they must deal with it is because of their own complicity. The Mahinda Rajapaksa Government could not mobilize people for a war. All they could do was talk about a racist war; their rhetoric was racist.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0dd6\u0dbd\u0dcf\u0dc3\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dbb\u0dd6\u0daa \u0dd9\u0db1\u0dca\u0dd3\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dd9\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0ba4\u0b95\u0bb2\u0b95\u0bae\u0ba4\u0bbe\u0b99\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bcd \u0b89\u0bb1\u0bc1\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bbf\u0ba9\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd) (The Hon. Presiding Member) \u0ba4\u0b95\u0bcc\u0bb0\u0bb5 \u0b89\u0bb1\u0bc1\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bbf\u0ba9\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bae\u0bb3, \u0b89\u0b99\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bc1\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bbe\u0ba9 \u0bae\u0ba8\u0bb0\u0bae\u0bcd \u0ba8\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bb1\u0bb5\u0b95\u0b9f\u0b95\u0bbf\u0ba9\u0bcd\u0bb1\u0ba4\u0bc1.\n\n\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0dd3\u0dc0.\u0dd3\u0dc0. \u0db1\u0db4\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0db1\u0db8\u0dca\u0db6\u0dbd\u0db8\u0dca \u0dd9\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b9c\u0bc0.\u0b9c\u0bc0. \u0ba4\u0baa\u0bbe\u0ba9\u0bcd\u0ba9\u0bae\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bb2\u0bae\u0bcd) (The Hon. G.G. Ponnambalam) I am finishing up, Sir.\n\nSo, they wanted somebody else who could go and make a credible case for war, to mobilize the war. And, it was the JVP who did that; it was their former comrade"
